{
  "source": "Outbound_Invoice_File_Structure.xlsx",
  "read_me": [
    "FHEAD                     - once, first line",
    "  THEAD                   - one per document",
    "    TDETL                 - merchandise item lines (0...n)",
    "      TALLW               - allowances, must follow their TDETL (0...n) -- not required now",
    "    TNMRC                 - non-merchandise costs (0...n)",
    "    TVATS                 - tax breakdown by tax code (0...n)",
    "  TTAIL                   - closes the document",
    "FTAIL                     - once, last line",
    "Character fields: left justified, right padded with blanks.",
    "Numeric fields: right justified, left padded with zeroes.",
    "Decimals are implied - no decimal point is written. Number(20,4) means 20 characters of which the last 4 are decimals; Number(20,10) means the last 10 are decimals.",
    "Amounts carry an explicit sign field (+ / -) immediately in front of them; the value itself is unsigned.",
    "Dates are Char(14) in YYYYMMDDHH24MISS format.",
    "Null values are blank (spaces).",
    "Every record is padded to its full fixed length - the program rejects a record whose length does not match."
  ],
